+matrix whose first 95 columns are parallel forces 95 determinant tests. Counting
+two products and one subtraction per test plus the final solve gives at most
+about **294 exact field operations**. A local CPython benchmark of 200,000 such
+worst-position searches took **7.453745 seconds**, or **37.27 microseconds per
+instance**.
