The strengthened G8 check now passes: 140/140 relabelling invariance checks, 140/140 carried witnesses, and 20/20 unrelated structural keys are distinct. All local gates pass; the shipping answer is 128 field elements (384 characters), the compact route is bounded at 255 operations, and the measured cubic reference averages about 1.064 million operations. I’m starting the script-owned bare oracle ladder.
